The schema: submit takes value: an array of arrays, where each inner array has items with enum ["a","b"], minLength 1, type string. The outer array type is array, no minItems constraint on the outer array. So the minimal valid value would be an empty array: {"value": []}

Since there's no minItems on the outer array, empty array is allowed. Inner arrays must have items of minLength 1 with enum a/b — but if outer array is empty, no inner arrays needed.

So minimal: {"value": []}
